    {
        "type": "prompt_intent",
        "value": "What is PHP and HTML?",
        "confidence": 0.6999999999999999555910790149937383830547332763671875,
        "source": "prompt",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:07:57-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "Here is a breakdown of what PHP and HTML are, how they differ, and how they work together to build websites",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "---\n\n### 1",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "HTML (HyperText Markup Language)\n\n**HTML** is the standard language used to create and structure web pages",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It is part of the **front-end** stack (client-side)",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "Think of HTML as the **skeleton** of a website",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It tells the web browser how to display the content visually",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **What it does:** It defines the structure, layout, and meaning of the content",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It creates elements like headings, paragraphs, images, links, and forms",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **How it works:** When a user visits your site, the browser receives an HTML file and translates those tags into pixels on the screen",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **Example:** An HTML tag looks like this:\n    ```html\n    <h1>Welcome to My Site<\/h1>\n    <p>This is a paragraph of text",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "<\/p>\n    ```\n    To the human reader, this looks like text",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "To the computer, it\u2019s instructions to draw a large heading and a small block of text below it",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "**Key Characteristic:** HTML is **static**",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It cannot change itself without someone manually editing the source code or refreshing the page",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "---\n\n### 2",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "PHP (Hypertext Preprocessor)\n\n**PHP** is a scripting language that runs on the **server-side** (the backend)",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It is the engine that makes websites interactive and dynamic",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "While HTML builds the page, PHP fills it with live data",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **What it does:** It handles the \"brains\" of the operation",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It connects to databases, processes user inputs (like forms), and calculates data before sending the final result to the browser",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **How it works:** You write PHP code inside special tags (usually `<",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "php",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": ">`)",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "When a user requests your website, the server executes these scripts, generates new HTML, and then sends that finished HTML to the user's browser",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **Example:** A PHP script might look at a database to find a user's name and insert it into the HTML:\n    ```php\n    <",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "php\n    \/\/ Connect to database and get user data here",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "$username = \"JohnDoe\";",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": ">\n    <p>Hello, <",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "php echo $username;",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": ">",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "Welcome back",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "<\/p>\n    ```\n\n**Key Characteristic:** PHP is **dynamic**",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "It can generate different content every time the page loads based on who is logged in, what they clicked, or data stored in a database",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "---\n\n### How They Work Together\n\nYou rarely use one instead of the other; they complement each other perfectly",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "1",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "**The Request:** A user types a URL into their browser",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "2",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "**The Server Processes PHP:** The server sees the request, runs the PHP code (which might check if the user is logged in or fetch data from a database)",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "3",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "**The Result:** PHP combines the existing HTML with the new data and outputs a complete HTML file",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "4",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "**The Display:** The browser receives the file and shows the user the final result",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "#### Simple Analogy\nImagine building a house:\n\n*   **HTML is the Bricks and Walls:** It provides the physical structure and shape of the house",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "Without it, there is no place for people to stand",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "*   **PHP is the Electrician\/Plumber:** It goes behind the scenes, wiring up the electricity and plumbing so the house becomes functional",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "If you want a light switch to turn on automatically when you walk by, that requires PHP logic",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    },
    {
        "type": "statement",
        "value": "### Summary Comparison\n\n| Feature | HTML | PHP |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Primary Role** | Structure & Layout (Front-End) | Logic & Data (Back-End) |\n| **Where it runs** | In the user's browser (Client-Side) | On the web server (Server-Side) |\n| **Visibility** | Visible to users (code is hidden via CSS) | Hidden from view (only the final HTML is shown) |\n| **Main Function** | Describes what the page contains | Decides what the page should contain |\n\nIn short: **HTML** is the face of your website (how it looks), while **PHP** is the brain (how it behaves)",
        "confidence": 0.8000000000000000444089209850062616169452667236328125,
        "source": "openrouter",
        "created_at": "2026-09-20T08:08:07-04:00"
    }
]